    SELECT 'roquedos-casmofiticos', '8210', 'Pendientes rocosas calcícolas con vegetación casmofítica', 'Terrestre', 'Paredes y cortados de roca caliza en los que la vegetación no vive sobre el suelo, sino dentro de las fisuras. Son plantas de raíz larguísima y crecimiento lentísimo, agarradas a la grieta, que aprovechan el agua que escurre por la pared. Los roquedos han quedado a salvo del arado y del ganado durante milenios, y por eso concentran una proporción altísima de especies que no existen en ningún otro lugar.', 0, 37.426388, -1.487499, '#8a7a6a', '{"type":"MultiPolygon","coordinates":[[[[-1.483729,37.438676],[-1.483757,37.438804],[-1.483783,37.438929],[-1.483798,37.439621],[-1.483614,37.441031],[-1.483629,37.441836],[-1.483411,37.442761],[-1.482978,37.443729],[-1.483018,37.443319],[-1.48328,37.442732],[-1.483494,37.441827],[-1.483478,37.441025],[-1.483663,37.439617],[-1.483658,37.43941],[-1.483649,37.438991],[-1.483729,37.438676]]],[[[-1.482812,37.4441],[-1.482777,37.444179],[-1.482744,37.444219],[-1.482692,37.444246],[-1.482631,37.44425],[-1.482617,37.444245],[-1.48258,37.444235],[-1.482812,37.4441]]],[[[-1.497322,37.42275],[-1.497274,37.422792],[-1.497202,37.422884],[-1.497145,37.422964],[-1.497072,37.423044],[-1.496972,37.423158],[-1.496914,37.423238],[-1.496842,37.423343],[-1.496756,37.423468],[-1.496698,37.423571],[-1.496612,37.423674],[-1.496554,37.423779],[-1.496496,37.423871],[-1.496424,37.424018],[-1.496367,37.424099],[-1.496309,37.424224],[-1.496223,37.424363],[-1.496136,37.424501],[-1.496065,37.424627],[-1.495978,37.42474],[-1.495892,37.424856],[-1.495805,37.424959],[-1.495719,37.425073],[-1.495647,37.425189],[-1.495575,37.425314],[-1.495489,37.425417],[-1.495402,37.425533],[-1.495316,37.425624],[-1.495215,37.425751],[-1.495129,37.425831],[-1.495028,37.425911],[-1.494912,37.426013],[-1.494812,37.426107],[-1.494711,37.426198],[-1.494625,37.426267],[-1.494509,37.426346],[-1.494366,37.426462],[-1.49425,37.426555],[-1.494121,37.426646],[-1.493948,37