    SELECT 'prados-alysso-sedion', '6110', 'Prados calcáreos cársticos o basófilos del Alysso-Sedion albi', 'Terrestre', 'Pastos abiertos sobre repisas y lanchas de roca caliza con apenas un dedo de tierra encima. Ahí solo prosperan plantas crasas de hojas gordas, como las uñas de gato (Sedum), y hierbas anuales minúsculas que nacen, florecen y mueren entre febrero y mayo. Ocupa superficies muy pequeñas y depende de que el suelo siga siendo escaso: en cuanto se acumula tierra, otras plantas lo desplazan.', 1, 37.427725, -1.486042, '#9c8a5e', '{"type":"MultiPolygon","coordinates":[[[[-1.491046,37.423918],[-1.49101,37.423848],[-1.490967,37.423808],[-1.490964,37.423695],[-1.491021,37.423602],[-1.491048,37.423494],[-1.491061,37.423368],[-1.490734,37.423364],[-1.490193,37.423347],[-1.489565,37.423299],[-1.489137,37.423323],[-1.488381,37.423324],[-1.488117,37.42334],[-1.488039,37.42348],[-1.487848,37.423558],[-1.487634,37.423565],[-1.48737,37.423542],[-1.487329,37.423702],[-1.487214,37.42379],[-1.487025,37.423808],[-1.486686,37.423794],[-1.486431,37.423817],[-1.486313,37.423606],[-1.486195,37.423441],[-1.486186,37.423296],[-1.486359,37.423135],[-1.486627,37.422994],[-1.486992,37.422883],[-1.487187,37.422827],[-1.487202,37.422664],[-1.487338,37.42253],[-1.487593,37.422466],[-1.487714,37.422468],[-1.487859,37.42245],[-1.487955,37.4225],[-1.488136,37.422492],[-1.488439,37.422448],[-1.488561,37.422401],[-1.488746,37.422211],[-1.488966,37.422069],[-1.489235,37.421938],[-1.489563,37.421846],[-1.489916,37.421725],[-1.49034,37.421663],[-1.490655,37.421628],[-1.490982,37.421584],[-1.491379,37.421705],[-1.491653,37.421872],[-1.491966,37.421944],[-1.492268,37.421938],[-1.49244,37.421805],[-1.492622,37.421769],[-1.492767,37.42178],[-1.492775,37.421993],[-1.492883,37.422042],[-1.493017,37.421957],[-1.493125,37.422026],[-1.493088,37.422222],[-1.493049,37.422385],[-1.493554,37.422527],[-1.493821,37.422634],[-1.49395,37.422686],[-1.494141,37.422843],[-1.494345,37.422903],[-1.494561,37.42